  "contentHtmlFurigana": "\n                      <div><br><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 3px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span class=\"s3\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 3px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span class=\"s3\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 3px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><ruby>皆<rt>みな</rt></ruby>さんこんにちは</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 3px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>鳥取<rt>とっとり</rt></ruby><ruby>県<rt>けん</rt></ruby><ruby>出身<rt>しゅっしん</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;18</span><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>歳<rt>とし</rt></ruby></span></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby><ruby>陽<rt>よう</rt></ruby><ruby>世<rt>よ</rt></ruby>（やまぐちはるよ）です</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>公式<rt>こうしき</rt></ruby>で<ruby>発表<rt>はっぴょう</rt></ruby>があった<ruby>通<rt>とお</rt></ruby>り<ruby>新型<rt>しんがた</rt></ruby>コロナウイルスに<ruby